---
import { CLASSIFICATION_LIMITS } from '../../data/classification-limits';
---
<aside class="calculator-notice" aria-labelledby="calculator-notice-title">
  <svg class="calculator-notice__icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13" /><path d="M16 14 V23 M16 9 V10" /></svg>
  <div class="calculator-notice__body">
    <h2 id="calculator-notice-title">Guidance, not an official classification</h2>
    <p>This illustrative Slovak ISVS model has gaps in control coverage. Confirm a real
      classification through your security manager and a formal risk analysis.
      The underlying framework changes on <strong>1 January 2027</strong>.</p>
    <details>
      <summary>Limits, framework change &amp; sources <span>5 references</span></summary>
      {CLASSIFICATION_LIMITS.map(limit => <p>{limit}</p>)}
      <p>U1–U4 come from a MIRRI methodological guideline, not from a decree.
        Under the successor framework, categories attach to the governing body rather than
        to the system, and measures follow a risk analysis. The operator remains responsible
        for classification; this example does not approve a cloud placement.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Workbook</dt><dd>MIRRI SR — <em>Určenie parametrov UxCxIxAx</em>, príloha č. 1, v10.0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Guidance</dt><dd>MIRRI SR — <em>Metodické usmernenie pre klasifikáciu ISVS</em>, 023107/2023/oSBATA-1</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Act</dt><dd>Zákon č. 69/2018 Z. z. o kybernetickej bezpečnosti, §20</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Decree</dt><dd>Vyhláška č. 165/2018 Z. z. — kritériá kategórií incidentov</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Framework transition</dt><dd><a href="https://kyberportal.slovensko.sk/aktuality/nov%C3%A1-vyhl%C3%A1%C5%A1ka-k-bezpe%C4%8Dnostn%C3%BDm-opatreniam-itvs-menej-formality-viac-re%C3%A1lnej-bezpe%C4%8Dnosti/">Official notice: 184/2026 replaces 179/2020 from 1 January 2027</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </details>
  </div>
</aside>
<style>
  .calculator-notice { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-5); background: var(--color-surface-container-low); margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .calculator-notice__icon { width: var(--space-6); height: var(--space-6); flex-shrink: 0; fill: none; stroke: var(--color-primary); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .calculator-notice__body { min-width: 0; }
  h2 { font: var(--weight-semibold) var(--text-title-md) / var(--leading-snug) var(--font-display); color: var(--color-navy); }
  p { margin-top: var(--space-2); font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--color-on-surface-muted); max-width: 94ch; }
  details { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  summary { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--text-label-md); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); cursor: pointer; width: fit-content; }
  summary span { margin-left: var(--space-3); color: var(--color-meta-label); font-weight: var(--weight-regular); }
  dl { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  dl > div { display: grid; gap: var(--space-1); }
  dt { font: var(--text-label-sm) var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary); }
  dd { font-size: var(--text-label-md); color: var(--color-on-surface-muted); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); }
  dd a { color:var(--color-primary); }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { dl { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4); } }
</style>

